{"ret":0,"iRet":0,"sMsg":"ok","jData":{"iRet":"0","sMsg":"ok","data":[{"sAutoUserLevel":"","sIpLinkUrl":"","sTvideoFileSize":"","sPicsNew":[],"sUrl":"","iFrom":0,"sIdxTime":"2026-09-27 15:16:03","sPicTypesNew":[],"sDesc":"","sPicSizesNew":[],"sIMG":"//static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790492811_31951d68f989cd1cb6a4b33d850972dc.jpg","iStatus":1,"sOuterHelperId":"","iCollectionNum":0,"sIsIpContent":"","sCoverList":[{"size":"474*269","url":"//static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790492811_31951d68f989cd1cb6a4b33d850972dc.jpg","urlCI":"","type":"main","id":1,"imgType":"jpeg"},{"size":"474*269","url":"//static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790492817_31951d68f989cd1cb6a4b33d850972dc.jpg","urlCI":"","type":"main","id":2,"imgType":"jpeg"},{"id":6895,"imgType":"","size":"0*0","url":"","urlCI":"","type":"reco"},{"size":"0*0","url":"","urlCI":"","type":"reco","id":6898,"imgType":""},{"size":"0*0","url":"","urlCI":"","type":"reco","id":6914,"imgType":""}],"iInfoType":1,"sInnerUserLevel":"","sAuthor":"三角洲行动","sPics":[],"sRedirectURL":"https://df.qq.com/cp/a20240906main/newsdetail.html?id=2756214152185665563","cache":1,"sTitle":"我来同你玩！——《三角洲行动》二洲年庆典圆满落幕！","iTopPos":0,"iCmtNum":0,"sMcnUuid":"","iTime":0,"authorID":"virtual_user","sGifHead":[""],"iShareNum":0,"sPicSizes":[],"sCreated":"2026-09-27 15:07:14","sPicTypes":[],"sMcnAvatar":"","iLikeNum":0,"sTagInfo":"131532|pc广告,131531|双端新闻广告,131533|移动广告,127223|新闻,127222|三角洲行动官网新闻页,143390|首页最新热点-最新,135148|官方小程序专用","sExt1":"","iBiz":423,"sGifHeadNew":[],"sTagids":[131532,131531,131533,127223,127222,143390,135148],"sExt9":0,"sIsVerticalVideo":"","sIMGNew":"","sVID":"","iIsRedirect":1,"iTotalPlay":0,"iPrivate":0,"sIpIsLinkJoip":"","iId":18887569,"sContent":"<p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><br /><strong><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">9月25日至26日，《三角洲行动》二洲年庆典在重庆巴南区华熙生物&middot;润百颜ECM中心举办。两天的庆典里，烽火明星表演赛欢乐开场，2026烽火职业联赛夏季赛总决赛巅峰收官，年度发布揭晓未来版本规划，黑潮爆破全明星表演赛与二洲年音乐会轮番上演。数千名干员来到现场，更多干员通过全平台直播与我们一同见证这场属于所有人的洲年盛会。</span></strong></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790492485_c48e0ca2bc76aa58f82119712cd34a15.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1102\" style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 2; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 24px;\">明星队正面硬刚\"老赛\"，开局被团灭成最大名场面</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2; text-align: left;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">9月25日，二洲年庆典&middot;烽火明星表演赛率先开打。品牌大使范丞丞、陈赫、何润东组成\"明星队\"，与白泽、刘回、斩虍、COKE、兔娘、猪猪小野、逗比的雀巢、嗨氏、伢伢gagako、Mad98、孟西、腥味猫罐、南波万、蛋挞小屁孩、小two姐姐组成的五支队伍同台打洲。特邀解说林树、杨齐家也到场助阵。</span><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">而让全场共同高呼的一幕，则是来自明星队与首领\"赛伊德\"的一次正面遭遇。开局不久，三人在零号大坝的走廊里撞上赛伊德，范丞丞与何润东没有绕开，选择直接对枪，结果被两下撂倒；更有趣的是，在队友接连倒下时，陈赫还在\"美美得吃\"，慌忙推门出去接战，最终成为第三个倒下的人。明星队就此被老赛团灭，三人自己也没想到会这么快\"下班\"。</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790492564_d6fb0de01cc1fe16149ec5ebb475d7b1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1281\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790492575_7b8511ccc46e4554f82ea0e034398bd9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790492589_f7bf0e935e30492d4cd6d1d60d0da199.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1204\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 2; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 2; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 24px;\">TES山城加冕，成就春夏连冠</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2; text-align: left;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">9月25日，2026烽火职业联赛（DFPL）夏季赛总决赛接棒开战。历经五周常规赛与季后赛的层层选拔，RSG、IBG、TES、EGG、SYG、WFG六支顶尖战队齐聚山城，在观众的呐喊声中，向夏季赛冠军发起最后的冲击。</span><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">本次决赛的悬念一直留到了最后一刻。曼德尔砖数度易手，战队们先后开启赛点。TES在乱战中稳住节奏，顶住各路强敌的轮番反扑，完成曼德尔砖破译，捧起夏季赛冠军奖杯。RSG、IBG分获亚军、季军。这是TES继春季赛在北京捧杯之后，再度站上领奖台，完成春夏连冠，TES｜white也荣膺总决赛FMVP。</span><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">根据最终积分排名，TES、RSG、IBG三支队伍将代表赛区出征11月瑞典斯德哥尔摩烽火世界杯，向世界冠军发起冲击。</span><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790492627_b64ce8f83cac4028c2e69a29a47de3fa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790492634_15b0fd5afdb84c0d288c7317e2b66277.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2; text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 24px;\">感谢干员们的一路相伴，新的旅程继续把洲做好！</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">9月26日，年度发布环节开启，《三角洲行动》制作人Shadow面向全体干员公布了后续版本规划及全新技术升级内容。</span><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790492678_c6aee4fbbee89b69b36aedefc2220c0b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1593\" height=\"896\" /></span><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">下个赛季，UE5技术升级实装，全面战场新地图天际线将在11月登场，为干员们带来更高规格的体验。</span><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790492685_f0c37376740666191ebb767a73434314.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1593\" height=\"896\" /></span><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">而在2027年春节，烽火地带会迎来新的选题和新的尝试。我们将带大家进入一个前所未有的战局：【围城】。高墙之内是内城，是科技、财富和核心机密高度聚集的地方，但也危机四伏。在同一堵高墙之外，则是完全相反的世界&mdash;&mdash;外城，这里是一片混乱之地，建筑残破、秩序坍塌。但也鱼龙混杂充满机遇。我们希望打破普通｜机密｜绝密&ldquo;次元壁&rdquo;，让原本互不相通的对局，在围城中相遇。希望让干员们玩得更尽兴！</span><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790492693_ba0e429b6ae1012a77ff543482c57524.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1593\" height=\"896\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790492699_ff4cb0af72131560d522cd5d7402796b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1593\" height=\"896\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790492706_365e4972be7c26ac8f58c5374a917158.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1593\" height=\"896\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">不仅尽兴，我们还希望干员们在洲里更自在、更热闹！全新靶场、G.T.I.小屋、群星计划等内容，也将在未来陆续上线。</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790492965_a77e931c0655236fc164579272b95f90.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1593\" height=\"896\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790492970_be4d3bf45484a1aaa349c973488f31f4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1593\" height=\"896\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">我们还希望&ldquo;洲&rdquo;的世界，能更宽、更有包容度，去真正装下大家更多的想象力。因此，我们带来了全新的联动计划。三角洲行动x影之刃零，联动确认！与泡泡玛特-共鸣的联动内容也将在2027年春节上线。</span><br /><br /></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790492983_ab23a0b555a180a192522b5adb9beb9e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1593\" height=\"896\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790492988_5384c4747834eca0a54641dd64544097.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1593\" height=\"896\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">三角洲行动还将与INART携手，推出威龙款1/6收藏级可动人偶。也将携手阅文好物推出第一弹合作产品，请大家关注后续资讯。</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790492996_403bcca23f2df5be706fc0f9d88d06d4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1593\" height=\"896\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">此外，全新玩法黑潮爆破Beta赛季将于9月27日正式开启。这是洲的一次全新尝试，我们仍然有需要验证和打磨的地方，欢迎大家来体验，诚邀大家建议与锐评！</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790493008_626f79db7471c0e5eef97586a6110c1f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 2; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 24px;\">黑潮爆破表演赛登场，巅峰对决一触即发！</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">9月26日，黑潮爆破表演赛登场，十位选手组成两支全明星阵容，展开5V5团队对抗。并特邀了玩机器丶Machine担任对局解说。</span><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">由 DANK1NG、老飞宇66、bbFps、JDG｜duyilin、eStar｜Pfe1 组成的\"赢你无需第二遍\"队各司其职，从进攻突破到道具配合，干净利落。</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790493045_80fe4f752eef03c87d1bed678750acdb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1165\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">由 Xleft小叮当、YJJ、昊天、SYG｜成成大王、LGD｜myers 组成的\"秒你无需第二枪\"队火力全开，配合默契，一枪定局。</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790493053_6474ef12c3db82679c5d6f7beac884ed.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">两支全明星阵容在黑潮爆破的赛场上狭路相逢，为干员们带来了一场名副其实的巅峰对决。</span><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790493061_63fe03e8144e70ac69ad608e132874fc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2; text-align: center;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 24px;\">二洲年音乐会《星河追梦》全场合唱，彦祖惊喜现身！</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">作为庆典的压轴环节，二洲年音乐会为干员们献上了一场热血与共鸣交织的视听盛宴。整场音乐会分为\"同燃\"、\"同欢\"、\"同梦\"三大篇章，环环相扣，高能不断。</span><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">同燃&mdash;&mdash;三角洲官方歌曲原声放送。在&ldquo;同燃&rdquo;篇章， 伴随着《阿萨拉之声》的琴声响起，音乐正式开场。随后《MADE OF FIRE（怒火燎原）》、《Lone Survivor（落日归途）》、《Dawn（黎明将至）》等官方原声曲目轮番放送，熟悉的主题旋律被交响编制重新演绎，开场即把洲年气氛拉满。</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790493100_24f15448895588efc079a5571428f5c1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1012\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">R.E.D也带来《方洲行动组曲》，多个青春活力舞台成为庆典亮眼时刻。</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790493107_e973652b16b04386fb8088d48bbe06ea.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1051\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">汪晨蕊登台献唱《GOT YOU（归零）》，以极具穿透力的嗓音拉开洲年之夜的序幕。</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790493115_2bf03b935481257d348f70958781859b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"738\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;随后，&ldquo;同欢&rdquo;篇章开启，节奏切换，这一次彦祖随着《&dagger;TAKEDISKRUSH!&dagger;》惊喜登场，搭配经典组枪画面引爆全场！</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790493262_db0588bcc6fa5e5dc89c44e527946686.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1044\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790493268_7cb1988b91314347c45957d8baf5eab0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1221\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">随后宝石Gem用说唱将气氛再度推至沸点，《枪火》、《难得真兄弟》等社区爆火曲目接连唱响&mdash;&mdash;这些由玩家二创、在社群里口口相传的旋律，如今被搬进聚光灯下，每一句大合唱都是两年来并肩作战的回响。</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790493277_a6f85c6e5e95888977c195447087de71.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"947\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">最后，&ldquo;同梦&rdquo;篇章开启。全干员一起登场演绎的《三角洲流星雨》，与现场数千名干员一起把气氛推向顶点。每一位干员都是一枚流星，群星汇聚，共同点亮璀璨星河。</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790493284_e4957a26c8eb0fc37ee9d89538485983.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1110\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">当《星河追梦》旋律响起，由黄宗辉及重庆大剧院爱乐童声合唱团带领全场干员齐声合唱，灯光随节奏扫过场馆的每个角落&mdash;&mdash;那一刻，舞台与观众席之间再无界限，成为整场庆典最动人的记忆点。</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790493292_647b688cf6704cd9d7116c66538635b1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1081\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790493298_e2ff74b3737d95f44ef5f2f1e8922ec3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1084\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><br /><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">终章则随着威龙的故事缓缓展开，彦祖再次登台，引领全场干员齐声高喊\"我来同你玩\"&mdash;&mdash;这一句约定，既是洲年之夜的谢幕，也是三角洲故事下一段征程的开篇。</span><br /><br /></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790493312_964ff228db1c62726fb7bc92ff105e73.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><img src=\"https://static.gametalk.qq.com/image/423/1790493318_6368fa1b0eadc57b67f3f730d7589c1d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"989\" /></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">两天时间，从明星表演赛的欢笑到职业赛场的呐喊，从年度发布的期待到音乐会的合唱，二洲年庆典在重庆落下帷幕。感谢每一位到场和守候在直播间的干员。</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"color: #ecf0f1;\"><strong><span style=\"letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 18px;\">未来，《三角洲行动》还将带来更多精彩活动，期待与各位干员继续同行。洲年之约，我们再来一起玩！</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"line-height: 2;\">&nbsp;</p>","sOuterUserId":"","sMcnAuthorId":"","sMids":"","sChannelInfo":"6895|最新,6898|新闻,6914|头条新闻","sChannelInfoJson":[{"sChannelId":"6895","sChannelName":"最新","sChannelTitle":"我来同你玩！——《三角洲行动》二洲年庆典圆满落幕！"},{"sChannelId":"6898","sChannelName":"新闻","sChannelTitle":"我来同你玩！——《三角洲行动》二洲年庆典圆满落幕！"},{"sChannelTitle":"我来同你玩！——《三角洲行动》二洲年庆典圆满落幕！","sChannelId":"6914","sChannelName":"头条新闻"}],"iDocID":"2756214152185665563"}]},"sAmsSerial":"AMS-DFM-1016171651-maVvpf-670608-329870"}